Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 19:04:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/16] Isolate Vesper protocol handlers

Register Vesper-owned URL schemes, normalise them at the application boundary, and use them for Windows notification launches. Signal's protocol associations remain untouched.

Signed-off-by: amber <amber@flourish.ch>
